Note on the lens data (data/lenses.json, data/meta.json)

The lens specifications are factual data compiled from public manufacturer
specification pages, B&H, and DPReview, with per-segment provenance recorded in
data/sources.md. Individual facts (focal length, weight, price, etc.) are not
themselves copyrightable; the license above applies to this particular curated
compilation, schema, and presentation. No paywalled or proprietary review data
(for example, full DXOMark or lab test datasets) is reproduced. Where a value
could not be reliably sourced it is left null rather than guessed.
